OL,3,GNEWSAMurder arrest after man's death in
OL,4,ARochdale
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man in his 40s has been arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of murder after another man
OL,8,Fdied at a property in Rochdale.
OL,10,FPolice were called to Curzon Road at
OL,11,F19:55 BST on Wednesday over concerns
OL,12,Ffor the welfare of a man at a property.
OL,14,FEmergency services attended and the man
OL,15,Fdied at the scene.
OL,17,FDet Supt Richard Hunt said officers
OL,18,Fwere working "at pace" to establish the
OL,19,Fcircumstances surrounding the death.
